{"id":"n23972-1-10","stage":3,"title":"관계없이 · 没关系地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23972-1-10-1","ko":"결혼하면 회사를 그만두실 건가요?","zh":"结婚之后您要辞职吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"결혼하면","meaning":"结婚","explanation":"결혼하다：结婚；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"결혼하다","audio":"/audio/8f40b8da9c69319343f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17314","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결혼하면","audio":"/audio/7a319b7edec04bf8d09b.mp3"}},{"text":"회사를","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사를","audio":"/audio/62f80adf2dcac5e0aace.mp3"}},{"text":"그만두실","meaning":"罢休，放弃","explanation":"그만두다：罢休，放弃；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"그만두다","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62318","senseId":"2","lemma":"그만두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만두실","audio":"/audio/67ebd84cf27f94f004ca.mp3"}},{"text":"건가요?","meaning":"表示打算、决定（-ㄹ/을 거다）","explanation":"거：表示打算、决定（-ㄹ/을 거다）；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건가요","audio":"/audio/d23ae34a616ec8bb1263.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8f40b8da9c693193","term":"결혼하다","zh":"结婚","audio":"/audio/8f40b8da9c69319343f7.mp3","entryId":"17314","definition":"男性和女性在法律上成为夫妻。","pronunciation":["결혼하다"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"55dca49e4d54e352","term":"그만두다","zh":"罢休，放弃","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3","entryId":"62318","definition":"不做打算以后要做的事情。","pronunciation":["그만두다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示打算、决定（-ㄹ/을 거다）","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示打算、决定（-ㄹ/을 거다）","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/46a24b15b04809deafd6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23972-1-10-2","ko":"아니요. 결혼과는 관계없이 지금처럼 제 일을 할 거예요.","zh":"不。无论是否结婚，我都会像现在一样继续做自己的工作。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}},{"text":"결혼과는","meaning":"结婚","explanation":"결혼：结婚；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"결혼","audio":"/audio/da38b2d66ddadc4ca840.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31665","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결혼과는","audio":"/audio/869157c34b9f7a9ea6b5.mp3"}},{"text":"관계없이","meaning":"没关系地，无关地","explanation":"관계없이：没关系地，无关地","readings":[{"term":"관계없이","audio":"/audio/cadf0107643f31edb2d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23972","senseId":"1","lemma":"관계없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"관계없이","audio":"/audio/cadf0107643f31edb2d6.mp3"}},{"text":"지금처럼","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금처럼","audio":"/audio/37f5e33a01396ecbc8b3.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"s